 "first_unresolved_step": "ATTEMPT.md step 11: no concrete composite or pseudo-Goldstone Higgs model is solved, so the two numbers that set the composite clock margin are undetermined: s (dimensionless strain coefficient of the composite-scale mass-squared in units of Lambda^2) and A = d ln m_H^2 / d ln Lambda^2 (here borrowed as Lambda^2/m_H^2); the clock needs s*A <= 6.7e12 (5.0e11 with the largest slope estimator). Upstream of this, the axioms supply neither the strain-to-coupling response law (sign and log of the toy flip with it, step 9) nor any Higgs or composite sector.",
